sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route / Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant K8sAuth as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant REST as REST Container<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (loopback)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / MySQL<br/>5432/TCP or 3306/TCP

    Note over Client,DB: Flow 1: Model Registry REST API Request (Authenticated)
    Client->>Route: HTTPS POST /v1/model_registry/{name}/...<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>Proxy: HTTPS (re-encrypt)<br/>Bearer Token forwarded
    Proxy->>K8sAuth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>TLS, SA Token
    K8sAuth-->>Proxy: Authorized (get services/{name})
    Proxy->>REST: HTTP localhost:8080<br/>No auth (loopback)
    REST->>DB: TCP 5432/3306<br/>Optional SSL, DB credentials
    DB-->>REST: Query results
    REST-->>Proxy: JSON response
    Proxy-->>Route: HTTPS response
    Route-->>Client: HTTPS JSON response

    Note over Client,DB: Flow 2: Gateway API Model Registry Access
    participant GW as Data Science Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    Client->>GW: HTTPS POST /model-registry/{name}/*<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>Proxy: HTTPS via HTTPRoute<br/>Bearer Token
    Proxy->>K8sAuth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8sAuth-->>Proxy: Authorized
    Proxy->>REST: HTTP localhost:8080
    REST->>DB: TCP query
    DB-->>REST: Results
    REST-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>GW: HTTPS response
    GW-->>Client: HTTPS JSON response

    Note over Client,DB: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
    participant APIServer as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as Model Registry Operator
    participant OSAPI as OpenShift API<br/>(Routes, Groups, Config)
    APIServer->>Operator: Watch notification (Informer)<br/>ModelRegistry CR changed
    Operator->>APIServer: CRUD Deployments, Services,<br/>ConfigMaps, Secrets, PVCs,<br/>NetworkPolicies, RBAC<br/>TLS, SA Token
    Operator->>OSAPI: Create/update Routes, Groups<br/>Read Ingress domain, TLS profile<br/>TLS, SA Token
    APIServer-->>Operator: Resource status updates
